rchived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":6,"created_at":"2024-12-21T09:10:20Z","updated_at":"2024-12-21T13:11:45Z","closed_at":"2024-12-21T13:06:06Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100690","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100690","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100690.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100690.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Another alternative that closes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/11238\r\nFollows up #100135\r\nFor the discussion, see the proposal\r\n\r\n`@hide_from_dialog` allows you to hide a global script with a global type name hidden from the create dialog. `@suffix` allows you to set a custom suffix for the script. A custom suffix will replace the file name with the suffix you set. An empty custom suffix will hide the suffix from all create dialogs.\r\nE.g.\r\n```GDScript\r\n@suffix(\"Custom suffix\")\r\nclass_name MyClass\r\nextends Node\r\n```\r\nthis will turn\r\n```\r\nNode\r\n| - MyClass (my_class.gd)\r\n```\r\ninto\r\n```\r\nNode\r\n| - MyClass (Custom suffix)\r\n```\r\n\r\n# Note\r\nI added few protected variables in `Script` class and getter methods, which is beneficial for the future continuations based on this pr\r\n\r\nAlternative: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100349\r\nOnly one of the two pr will be merged, and the other one will be closed if not.","closed_by":{"logi